#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:5
#: 815f7f82f3d0473bbca725c49b932df0
msgid "ArduPilot Custom Firmware Builder"
msgstr "ArduPilot 自定义固件构建器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:7
#: 393b7eef79e14ccdb74d87cfc6d14c9b
msgid ""
"As the ArduPilot software evolves through community contributions and "
"development efforts, it’s expanding rapidly with many new features being "
"added. However, not all users need every feature. Depending on their "
"specific requirements and applications, users might prefer to exclude "
"certain features from the software."
msgstr ""
"随着 ArduPilot "
"软件通过社区贡献和开发工作不断发展，它正在迅速扩展并增加了许多新功能。然而，并非所有用户都需要每个功能。根据其具体需求和应用，用户可能希望从软件中排除某些功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:9
#: 4afc093462de49299f82b965adbc3269
msgid ""
"To address this need, we have developed the **Custom Firmware Builder**, a "
"web application hosted at `custom.ardupilot.org "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__. This process helps in reducing the "
"firmware size, making it easier to fit into flight control units (FCUs) with"
" limited flash memory. It also benefits our testers, allowing them to test "
"specific features without needing to upgrade their flight controllers due to"
" space constraints."
msgstr ""
"为满足这一需求，我们开发了 **自定义固件构建器**，这是一个托管在 `custom.ardupilot.org "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 的 Web 应用程序。这一过程有助于减小固件大小，使其更容易适配 Flash "
"内存有限的飞控（FCU）。它也有益于我们的测试人员，使他们能够测试特定功能，而无需因空间限制而升级飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:11
#: c5171c2fce974ae1a10ce6c5b489d271
msgid ""
"The source code of the custom firmware builder can be found `here. "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/>`__"
msgstr "自定义固件构建器的源代码可在 `这里 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/CustomBuild/>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:14
#: 8f7712ac651a4685aa0ac1527cf640cb
msgid "Submitting a build request"
msgstr "提交构建请求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:16
#: 52ef8a0888ed411c87dfce53261e8341
msgid "To submit a build request, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要提交构建请求，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:18
#: 72d79b62060749c7850c6dcb7466d6c4
msgid ""
"Click the **'Add a build'** button located at the top right corner of the "
"homepage."
msgstr "点击主页右上角的 **「Add a build」** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:24
#: 354d0f2ab2374ed2b5ca1502ebe00e5f
msgid ""
"Choose the vehicle, version, and board,in that order, for which you want to "
"build the firmware."
msgstr "按顺序选择飞行器类型、版本和飞控板，然后为其构建固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:30
#: d6f8878850aa484f8de38745891dbc0d
msgid "Select the features you wish to include in the firmware"
msgstr "选择要包含在固件中的功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:32
#: 42e67059bd2440d5a86fba93959b02f5
msgid ""
"The default features for the board/vehicle will automatically be selected"
msgstr "该飞控板/飞行器类型的默认功能将自动选中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:33
#: 9ed658b9cd9f40dc8979fac4fb995232
msgid ""
"Some features depend on other features so when a feature is selected, all "
"its dependencies will be automatically selected but if the feature is later "
"deselected, the dependencies are not automatically deselected"
msgstr "某些功能依赖于其他功能，因此选择某功能时，其所有依赖项将自动选中；但如果后来取消选择该功能，其依赖项不会自动取消选中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:34
#: 7f4ef380dd88405e86929c1268e43b5e
msgid ""
"It is possible to select a set of features that will not fit on a board "
"which will cause the build will fail."
msgstr "可能选择一组功能导致固件超出板子容量，从而使构建失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:36
#: 0efc01a57ac349dd823b8e3f30e5142b
msgid ""
"Click the **'Generate'** button. You will be redirected to the homepage, and"
" a build log for the request you just submitted will appear."
msgstr "点击 **「Generate」** 按钮。您将被重定向到主页，刚刚提交的请求的构建日志将出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:37
#: 3465e57b781f4860a20cf65e3196219b
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, click the **'folder'** icon next to your build "
"request entry in the build list table. This will take you to the directory "
"on the server where your build artifacts are hosted. Download the .apj file"
msgstr ""
"构建完成后，点击构建列表表格中构建请求条目旁边的 **「folder」** 图标。这将带您到服务器上托管构建产物的目录。下载 .apj 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:38
#: 9394c19a7749416aa024207bcb9b5426
msgid ""
"Use your GCS to install the .apj file onto your autopilot.  If using Mission"
" Planner, open the Install Firmware and click then \"Load custom firmware\" "
"link"
msgstr ""
"使用地面站将 .apj 文件安装到飞控上。如果使用 Mission Planner，打开安装固件界面并点击 「Load custom firmware」"
" 链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:45
#: d8d5e3133dbd45fba077335a3b7199a9
msgid "Versions"
msgstr "版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:48
#: d2675fa3a6414cc5815b88933ddedf67
msgid "Latest"
msgstr "Latest（最新版）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:49
#: 7a5a02b2b62c4b8ea029e5fad1b71db9
msgid ""
"This is the current development branch of ArduPilot. It includes new "
"features, enhancements, clean-ups, etc. but has not been through a release "
"cycle of beta testing. It has been alpha tested and thoroughly tested in "
"ArduPilot's Continuous Integration auto-test suite. Many experienced users "
"select this to get the latest features but it has the highest risk, in terms"
" of potential bugs."
msgstr ""
"这是 ArduPilot 的当前开发分支。它包含新功能、增强、清理等，但尚未经过 Beta 测试发布周期。它已经过 Alpha 测试，并在 "
"ArduPilot 持续集成自动测试套件中经过了全面测试。许多有经验的用户选择此版本以获取最新功能，但它具有最高风险，可能存在潜在错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:52
#: e9d2245cddfe452e8507a02c05af1a43
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta（测试版）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:53
#: f56fd8e338bb4ce89be6eb57052cb761
msgid ""
"This is a release of the development branch used for widespread testing and "
"feedback. While the risk of major issues is low, it is expected that minor "
"behavioral deviations may pop up. These are normally addressed in later beta"
" releases of a major new release before declaring the code as a stable "
"release."
msgstr ""
"这是用于广泛测试和反馈的开发分支版本。出现重大问题的风险较低，但预计可能出现轻微的行为偏差。这些问题通常在主要新版本声明为稳定版之前的后续 Beta "
"版本中得到解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:56
#: 718893fa12e74cf785e32094f7a8e10f
msgid "Stable"
msgstr "Stable（稳定版）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:57
#: 12f9e25070cf410fb94ecbf74f44d4e4
msgid ""
"These are fully released versions of the code. There are usually several "
"minor releases for each major release number which correct any anomalies "
"found during the beta testing phases. These releases, have the lowest risk. "
"It is recommended that the highest numbered major/minor release be used in a"
" given release sequence, unless an older version is needed."
msgstr ""
"这些是代码的完整发布版本。每个主要版本号通常有几个次要版本，用于修正 Beta "
"测试阶段发现的异常。这些版本风险最低。建议在给定的发布序列中使用编号最高的主要/次要版本，除非需要使用旧版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:60
#: 25d243d48fb8474ebbc16f1647f48191
msgid "Guide to Size Impacts"
msgstr "尺寸影响指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:62
#: 94c1811c0c04466695a411b3a0b6c269
msgid ""
"Often, the custom build server is used to create firmware with features that"
" have been removed in the standard firmware to conserve flash space, but "
"desired by the user. If a build fails to complete due to lack of flash, the "
"user may remove features/sensors that are  not needed in order to make room "
"for those additional items wanted. In order to facilitate those choices, the"
" table below shows what impact a feature's removal has on flash size. Note "
"that a removed feature in this list automatically removed all features "
"dependent upon it."
msgstr ""
"通常，自定义构建服务器用于创建包含标准固件中为节省 Flash 空间而移除的功能的固件，但这些功能是用户需要的。如果构建因 Flash "
"不足而失败，用户可以移除不需要的功能/传感器，为所需的附加项腾出空间。为便于做出这些选择，下表显示了移除某功能对 Flash "
"大小的影响。注意，列表中移除某功能会自动移除所有依赖该功能的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:64
#: 2627b832b418437bb8de19d839358ef6
msgid ""
"the exact numbers of bytes will change slightly over time due to code "
"changes, but this table should be accurate enough to make decisions on "
"removal candidates to gain flash space."
msgstr "确切的字节数会随代码更改而略有变化，但此表应足够准确，可用于决定移除哪些候选项以获得 Flash 空间。"

